      "versionNonce": 214484422,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "updated": 1763000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "text": "- In-process cache (~60 s)\n  → Redis (LRU) → URL store\n- Cache TTL = min(24 h, expires_at)\n- Coalesce misses; jitter TTLs\n- Cache \"not found\" ~10 s so\n  scanners don't hit the store\n\nSignal: hit rate > 90%,\np99 < 100 ms",
      "originalText": "- In-process cache (~60 s)\n  → Redis (LRU) → URL store\n- Cache TTL = min(24 h, expires_at)\n- Coalesce misses; jitter TTLs\n- Cache \"not found\" ~10 s so\n  scanners don't hit the store\n\nSignal: hit rate > 90%,\np99 < 100 ms",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
